OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse charity backs new
OL,4,Awomen's court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuse charity has backed a
OL,7,Fnew specialist court in Merseyside
OL,8,Fdesigned to help women break the cycle
OL,9,Fof offending.
OL,11,FEve Donnelly, from Reverse NorthWest
OL,12,FCIC in Wallasey, said the new Intensive
OL,13,FSupervision Courts (ISCs) were
OL,14,F"fantastic" and offered a more "gentle"
OL,15,Falternative to prison for some
OL,16,Foffenders.
OL,18,FThe new courts, which tackle issues
OL,19,Fthat can drive some women to offend,
OL,20,Fare being rolled out across the
OL,21,Fcountry, including in Merseyside.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
